<title>FINLAND: HELSINKI BOURSE SAYS 96 PRE-TAX PROFIT UP 76 PCT.</title>
<headline>HELSINKI BOURSE SAYS 96 PRE-TAX PROFIT UP 76 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Helsinki Stock Exchange said in a statement on Monday its 1996 profit before appropriations and taxes rose 76 percent to 16.2 million markka from 9.2 million in 1996.</p>
<p>Revenues for the year were 48.2 million versus 44.7 a year earlier, it said.</p>
<p>--Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50 235</p>
</text>
